    <Placemark>
      <name>El Sabor Zapoteco (Teotitlán del Valle, Oaxaca - Primary)</name>
      <description>El Sabor Zapoteco - Teotitlán del Valle, Oaxaca (Primary)
📍 Avenida Juárez 30, Teotitlán del Valle, Oaxaca 70461, Mexico
📞 Email: info@elsaborzapoteco.com
🔗 https://www.instagram.com/p/DUJZ5y6koaE/
⭐ Signature Items:
• Black Bean Soup: Beans toasted on clay comal, ground on metate to powder, then cooked in aromatic chicken broth in minutes. Served with fried tortillas, avocado, cheese, and habanero-lime pickled onions
• Mole de Pipián: Nutty, creamy mole made from toasted pumpkin seeds ground with sesame seeds, onion, garlic, tomatillos, chiles, and epazote on the metate. Served with chicken or fish
• Salsa de Molcajete: Roma tomatoes roasted on comal with chiles de agua</description>
      <Point>
        <coordinates>-96.5194,17.0329,0</coordinates>
      </Point>
    </Placemark>
